    "https://www.cortlandaux.com/employment": {
      "title": "Employment",
      "description": "Employment with CAS at SUNY Cortland: Regular and Student Employment Skip to Content Phone 607-753-4627 Search User Menu Quick Links Contact Us Hours of Operation Connections Add Funds to Connections/View Meal Plan Balance Services Map Social Media Web Cameras Dining/Catering Menus & Facilities All Dining Facilities Menus Dining Hours Services Map Nutrition & Wellness Medical Nutritional Needs Nutrition & Allergen Symbols Sustainability Nutrition FAQs Meal Plans Meal Plans Purchase/Change Meal Plan How to Use Your Meal Plan Dining FAQs Concessions Catering Catering Menu Printable Catering Menu Event Order Form Feedback on Catered Events Visitor or Group Dining Campus Store Shop Online Package Services Store Hours Campus Store FAQs Employment Student Employment General Employment Current Employee Resources Essentials ID Card Paid Parking MicroFridge Laundry Banking Vending About Information Agency Accounts Cortland Auxiliary Grants Family Fund Information Release Form Mission Statement/Board of Directors Board of Directors (members only) Terms & Conditions Customer Questions/Feedback CAS Directory Employment Employment 11 reasons to be on our team – make a career with us! Regular Employee I want to apply* or find out more information . Benefits Generous benefits Competitive wages Paid time off Variety of schedules and positions State-of-the-art fitness center and pool Friendly work environment Training for promotional opportunities College Tuition Reimbursement Helping SUNY students learn and grow Management that values your insights Equal Opportunity Employer Student Employee I want to apply* or find out more information . See available shifts by work location & job Earn spending money Convenient, stable schedules Work from 3 to 25 hours weekly- you choose Time off during campus breaks Make friends Build your resume Learn some life skills for the future Management Training Program Visa Pay Card or Direct Deposit paycheck No need to reapply next semester Equal Opportunity Employer Cortland Auxiliary provides excellent service, exceptional value and we recognize our employees as our greatest resource. Looking for office or dining hours? We've got you! HOURS OF OPERATION Location Icon SUNY Cortland Auxiliary Services 15 Neubig Road Cortland, NY 13045 CONTACT US Phone Icon 607-753-4627 Follow us on Facebook Follow us on Instagram Employee Login @Cortland Auxiliary Services. All Rights Reserved. Site Created by Brockett Creative Group, Inc. Your browser is out-of-date! Update your browser to view this website correctly. Update my browser now ×"
