hletics Cortland Red Dragons Staff Directory Schedule Facilities Recruits Champions C-Club More + about Athletics Giving Giving Ways to Give Find Your Cause Naming Opportunities Give\n                            Now More + about Giving Careers Home Offices Human Resources Benefits Careers SUNY Cortland Employment With more than 1,400 employees, SUNY Cortland is the leading employer in both the city of Cortland and the county. In addition to having a significant impact on the local economy, we’re also one of the most desirable places to work in the area. Learn more about employment opportunities at SUNY Cortland . Staff job openings Faculty job openings All job openings About SUNY Cortland Accreditations Campus committees Diversity and inclusion DEI Facts and figures Faculty and staff excellence Campus Map and directions Mission, vision and priorities Red Dragon culture Sustainability Learn more about SUNY Cortland SUNY Cortland Employee Benefits Course auditing Employee Assistance Program Health, dental and vision insurance Memorial Library Raquette Lake outdoor resources Retirement savings and pension plans Paid family leave Paid time off Student Life Center membership Tuition reimbursement Learn more about employee benefits Live in Cortland Community events Homeownership program Housing information Family resources Food and drink Local fun Uniquely Cortland Well-being resources Learn more about Life in Cortland Visit Apply Request Info Employment Off-Campus Locations Campus Store Library Maps/​Directions Admissions Visits Virtual Tour Consumer Information Campus Safety Web Accessibility (opens new window) Complete the general Contact Us form PO Box 2000 Cortland, NY 13045 607-753-2011 FOLLOW US Cookie Consent We use cookies and similar technologies to improve your website experience and help us understand how you navigate our website. By using this site, you agree to our Privacy Policy . I Agree"
